      "name": "dsh-dev-modes",
      "title": {
        "en": "Development modes",
        "zh": "开发模式合集"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One install adds three Agent presets: Software development (read the repository, plan, implement in small steps, verify with the project's own tooling), Game development (prototype first, verify by running it; Godot, Unity, Unreal, and Cocos workflows included), and Read-only discussion (read and search only, no file writes or commands). The delivery and engine workflow skills ship with the bundle.",
        "zh": "一次安装新增三个 Agent 预设：软件开发（先读仓库与规范、规划后小步实现、用项目自身的构建与测试验证）、游戏开发（原型先行、真实运行验证手感与性能，内置 Godot / Unity / Unreal / Cocos 工作流）、只读讨论（能读能搜，不能写文件或执行命令）。交付流程与各引擎工作流技能随包附带。"
      },
